      </div>

      <!-- Hero Visual Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-japandi-clay/60 shadow-xl bg-japandi-sand/30 p-8 space-y-6">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-japandi-moss">Endodontic Excellence</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Save Your Natural Tooth</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-japandi-earth leading-relaxed font-light">
              No artificial implant can perfectly replicate the natural sensory feedback of your real tooth root. A timely root canal stops bacterial infection, protects bone density, and preserves your natural smile for life.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40">
