            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/60 border border-japandi-clay/40 text-xs text-japandi-charcoal space-y-1">
            <p class="font-medium">Transparent Pricing at Hennur:</p>
            <p class="text-japandi-earth font-light">Starting from Rs. 4,000 for anterior teeth to Rs. 10,000 for complex multi-rooted molars. Digital X-rays &amp; consultation: Rs. 600.</p>
          </div>
